  "verifiedConclusions": [
    "Server deployment capability is Boolean and derived solely from the existing trusted deployment restriction plus independently recognized read-only CI profile. No request-body or administrator override was added.",
    "AuthProvider accepts only Boolean mutationsAllowed, treats absent or malformed declaration as closed, invalidates while refreshing and on session replacement/auth failure/logout/local fallback, and retains request-generation/session rejection of stale auth results.",
    "Payment Collections automatic effect requires the explicit writable declaration and a user ID; its ref prevents duplicate automatic attempts for the same current identity during capability refresh and tab rerenders. Manual reconciliation and its own reminder actions check the same advisory gate.",
    "Writable Production retains the existing automatic reconciliation and forced manual reconciliation call shapes. Existing server handler mutation classifications, module/financial/external action gates remain authoritative.",
